"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967158402075000950\">https://x.com/i/status/1967158402075000950</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967158402075000950</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967158402075000950\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T09:28:05Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>retweet</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>fr</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967186305449963704":{"a":"<p>Definitely on the right track with UAP. @HISTORY needs to get the skinwalker folks a tablet based @Aaronia_AG spectrum analysis system with a proper antenna. I see signals I recognize but they need to measure multiple harmonics from like 1.8MHz-1.8GHz+.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSfprviXyoM\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/JSfprviXyoM\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JSfprviXyoM\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1966856630508941649\">https://x.com/i/status/1966856630508941649</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967186305449963704</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967186305449963704\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T11:18:58Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967186309212250464":{"a":"<p>Smoke, fog, Tesla coils (weatherproof winding this time) modulated with the correct synthwave beats and rhythm. Timecop 1983. Pay attention to track names. Play on folded horns at 1000W per the two channels. Cross phase the horns. Static opens the channel.<br>\n<a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLhRCbIq7GN_v7bIWNMRs-tAymIUUj2MyR\">youtube.com/playlist?list=…</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967186305449963704\">https://x.com/i/status/1967186305449963704</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967186309212250464</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967186309212250464\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T11:18:59Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967186312278237438":{"a":"<p>Another test is to generate a 438 or 146 MHz signal at 10W directly at the center of the dome. 📡〰️☁️ Try aiming a yagi both at the ground and at the sky while transmitting. Setup a receiver and spectrum analyzer at the bridge location. 😁 #skinwalker #uap</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967186309212250464\">https://x.com/i/status/1967186309212250464</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967186312278237438</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967186312278237438\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T11:19:00Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967193787203310018":{"a":"<p>Static opens the channel. Why is that important? You can&#x27;t jam a white/pink/brown noise source. To avoid accidental triggering you use a broadband burst on many wavelengths. Without burst it&#x27;ll startup but abort when it can&#x27;t vote in more than one channel. <a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1716131274727862418\">Tweet by @DavidLNorris</a></p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1716131274727862418\">https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1716131274727862418</a></blockquote>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967186312278237438\">https://x.com/i/status/1967186312278237438</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967193787203310018</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967193787203310018\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T11:48:42Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967194859049263598":{"a":"<p>Static opens the channel. To avoid weak signals from jamming the stronger military code. A common failure with SSB/AM communications.<br>\nDepartment of Energy Nuclear Emergency Support Team coded message.</p>\n<p>&quot;Sky King Sky King Do Not Answer&quot; echoes through time.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WdmS7r9TdzE\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/WdmS7r9TdzE\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WdmS7r9TdzE\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967193787203310018\">https://x.com/i/status/1967193787203310018</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967194859049263598</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967194859049263598\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T11:52:57Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967197306907926876":{"a":"<p>Break these songs down into the differences between them. Look for tone sequences that repeat three times in a row with a fourth frame that&#x27;s different slightly.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet embed embed-tweet\"><a href=\"https://x.com/i/status/1967186309212250464\">https://x.com/i/status/1967186309212250464</a></blockquote>","m":"<h1>Post 1967197306907926876</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967197306907926876\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T12:02:41Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>reply</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967198194615628005":{"a":"<p>UAP Tic Tac</p>\n<p>Imagine a magnetoreluctant aerogel shell holding vacuum. You can steer this ceramic balloon around like a laser pointer with space or land based masers and some secret pixie particles. <br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83Ff6LPZuq8\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div class=\"embed embed-youtube\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/83Ff6LPZuq8?enablejsapi=1\" title=\"YouTube\" allowfullscreen referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\"></iframe><p class=\"embed-fallback\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=83Ff6LPZuq8\">Watch on YouTube</a></p></div>","m":"<h1>Post 1967198194615628005</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/DavidLNorris/status/1967198194615628005\">View on X</a></p>\n<dl>\n<dt>when</dt><dd>2025-09-14T12:06:13Z</dd><dt>type</dt><dd>original</dd><dt>lang</dt><dd>en</dd><dt>likes</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>reposts</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>replies</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>thread</dt><dd>1</dd><dt>thread_count</dt><dd>9</dd><dt>conversation</dt><dd>1967198194615628005</dd>\n</dl>"},"1967199321000128708":{"a":"<p>This is the same concept. Imagine the powder particles are each Tictac objects. The laser causes an ion depletion zone which allows the powder/tictac to jump from one place to the next very very fast. Skipping like a stone across the pond through the sky.<br>\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_UOU5_4fnzs\">YouTube</a></p>\n<div c